# Host-local pi agent state. These hold live credentials or host-specific
# security rules and must never be committed to this (public) repo. Only the
# .example variants belong here. Belt and braces: the real files live in
# ~/.pi/agent and not in this tree, but the deploy direction for AGENTS.md is
# repo -> home, so a stray copy back the other way is a plausible accident.
pi/agent/agent-tokens.env
pi/agent/auto-mode.json
pi/agent/auth.json
